[Music]  this is an image that haunts every  parent in America  the desperate gathering for news after  yet another school shooting this time it  was North Park Elementary in San  Bernardino the lines of children being  escorted to safety as police responded  to gunfire in a special-needs classroom  police say 53 year old Cedric Anderson  entered that classroom and without  saying a word opened fire with a  revolver his target they say was the  teacher his wife Karen Smith she was  killed as was eight year old Jonathan  Martinez he'd been standing behind his  teacher at the time another boy was  injured and is said to be in a stable  condition Anderson then took his own  life police say they don't know what  motivated him they've only been married  for a few months and they've been  separated for about the last month month  and a half roughly when this incident  took place but there's nobody that in  the investigation that's come forward to  say that they saw this coming or knew  this was potentially happened there were  more than a dozen students in the  classroom at the time of the shooting no  others were physically harmed certainly  I'm hate to have to take care of  something like this where we understand  that family's lives have been impacted  irretrievably today and our thoughts and  prayers go out to the family members but  for parents and children alike as so  many times in the past  it is a scarring experience so she heard  everything it was 16 months ago when San  Bernardino was the scene of a mass  shooting at a Christmas party that left  14 dead that was a terrorist attack this  was something different but no less  devastating for the victims Greg Milam  Sky News

